inherit; margin-top: 12px; margin-right: 16px; margin-left: 52px; padding-bottom: 2px; vertical-align: baseline; color: var(--neutralDark); cursor: auto; user-select: text; overflow-y: auto; will-change: scroll-position;\"><div visiblity=\"visible\" style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\"><div style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\"><div lang=\"es-AR\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\"><p style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\">Estimado Alejandro:</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\">En el día de la fecha se le enviará un correo para descargar la OVA a través de un SFTP, la instalación de la misma y las configuraciones de red necesarias debe llevarse a cabo por personal de Migraciones de acuerdo a las siguientes especificaciones:</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><b><span style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: black;\">REQUERIMIENTO PARA INICIO DE SERVICIOS: PENTEST INTERNO&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\"><li style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\">Conexión VPN/SSL a la red interna,&nbsp;<span style=\"border: 1pt none windowtext; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\">split</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"border: 1pt none windowtext; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\">tunneling</span>, tolerable para clientes Linux.&nbsp;<i>La instancia debe tener llegada a las redes o segmentos de los activos.</i>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\"></span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\">Instalación de Scanner interno en forma de OVA (Máquina Virtual) con salida a internet.&nbsp;<i>La instancia debe tener llegada a las redes o segmentos de los activos.</i>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\"></span></li></ul><p style=\"font-kerning: none;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\">Ambas instancias deben tener llegada la red interna contemplada en&nbsp;<span style=\"border: 1pt none windowtext; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\">el&nbsp;alcance</span>&nbsp;sin restricción por puerto (TCP/UDP) o en su defecto&nbsp;<span style=\"border: 1pt none windowtext; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\">whitelisteada</span>&nbsp;de las herramientas de seguridad para no generar alarmas innecesarias.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 9pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\"></span></p><p style=\"font-kerning: none;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: in